---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Terms of Service — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description={`Terms of service for ${SITE_TITLE} (zylvion.xyz). The rules and conditions governing use of our website and content.`}
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": `Terms of Service — ${SITE_TITLE}`,
    "url": "https://zylvion.xyz/terms",
    "description": "Terms of service for Zylvion",
    "publisher": { "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization", "name": "Zylvion", "url": "https://zylvion.xyz" }
  })} />

  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: July 2025 &middot; Applies to zylvion.xyz</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-body prose">

        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using zylvion.xyz, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the site.</p>

        <h2>2. About Zylvion</h2>
        <p>Zylvion is an independent news publication. Zylvion situates today’s news inside the longer arcs of history, policy, and structural change — written for readers who think in decades. We publish original editorial content and are not responsible for third-party content linked from our site.</p>

        <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All original content published on zylvion.xyz — including articles, analysis, graphics, and code — is the intellectual property of Zylvion unless otherwise credited. You may share links to our content and quote brief passages with attribution, but you may not reproduce full articles without written permission.</p>

        <h2>4. Accuracy and Editorial Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>We make every reasonable effort to ensure factual accuracy in our reporting. However, news coverage involves interpretation and editorial judgement. Zylvion content is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute professional advice (legal, financial, medical, or otherwise). Readers should seek qualified professional guidance before making decisions based on information read here.</p>

        <h2>5. External Links</h2>
        <p>Zylvion links to external sources as part of our journalism. We are not responsible for the content, availability, or privacy practices of linked third-party websites. Linking does not constitute endorsement.</p>

        <h2>6. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree not to use zylvion.xyz for any unlawful purpose, to transmit harmful or malicious code, to attempt to gain unauthorised access to our systems, or to interfere with the site’s availability.</p>

        <h2>7. Corrections and Updates</h2>
        <p>We are committed to correcting factual errors. If you identify an error in our reporting, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. Corrections will be made promptly with appropriate disclosure.</p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>Zylvion is provided "as is". To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, we disclaim all warranties and shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the site or reliance on its content.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Material changes will be noted with an updated date. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance.</p>

        <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by applicable law. Any disputes shall be resolved in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which Zylvion operates.</p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Please use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
  .legal-title { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal-meta { font-family: var(--ui); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--dim); }
  .legal-body { max-width: 720px; padding: 3rem 0 5rem; }
</style>
